{"version":1,"content":"<p>濱崎真緒昨晚在夜場打碟疑被落藥，搞到要入ICU，事件引起全城關注。</p><p>身為DJ的樂宜跟濱崎真緒一樣，經常應邀到夜場打碟。</p><p>談到對方遇上落藥事件，她接受東網獨家訪問表示：「佢經理人其實係我前經理人，佢唔會畀藝人隨便飲酒嘅，所以我未遇過類似嘅情形，我</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:49.873818+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T07:42:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771600+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771600+00:00","content_hash":"1a8b0fc6b736746b6514aa3bfacc7fd9e7ce30fa77273ed963872af221b88fb4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}